text: ['({T}: Add {G} or {W}.)\\nCanopy Vista enters the battlefield tapped unless you control two or more basic lands.', '({T}: Add {U} or {B}.)\\nSunken Hollow enters the battlefield tapped unless you control two or more basic lands.', "As Choked Estuary enters the battlefield, you may reveal an Island or Swamp card from your hand. If you don't, Choked Estuary enters the battlefield tapped.\\n{T}: Add {U} or {B}.", "As Citadel Siege enters the battlefield, choose Khans or Dragons.\\n• Khans — At the beginning of combat on your turn, put two +1/+1 counters on target creature you control.\\n• Dragons — At the beginning of combat on each opponent's turn, tap target creature that player controls.", "As Fortified Village enters the battlefield, you may reveal a Forest or Plains card from your hand. If you don't, Fortified Village enters the battlefield tapped.\\n{T}: Add {G} or {W}.", 'As Unclaimed Territory enters the battlefield, choose a creature type.\\n{T}: Add {C}.\\n{T}: Add one mana of any color. Spend this mana only to cast a creature spell of the chosen type.', "As an additional cost to cast this spell, you may exile any number of creature cards from your graveyard. This spell costs {2} less to cast for each card exiled this way.\\nDeathtouch\\nWhenever Gorex, the Tombshell attacks or dies, choose a card at random exiled with Gorex and put that card into its owner's hand.", "At the beginning of combat on your turn, choose any number of creatures with different powers. Each of them gets +X/+X and gains vigilance until end of turn, where X is Sigardian Zealot's power.", 'At the beginning of your upkeep, create X 2/2 black Zombie creature tokens, where X is half the number of Zombies you control, rounded down.', "At the beginning of your upkeep, each player may put two +1/+1 counters on a creature they control. If a player does, creatures that player controls can't attack you or planeswalkers you control until your next turn.", 'At the beginning of your upkeep, put a +1/+1 counter on each other creature you control.', 'At the beginning of your upkeep, scry 1.\\nWhenever you cast a creature spell, you may pay {G}. If you do, draw a card.', "At the beginning of your upkeep, you lose 1 life and amass Zombies 1. (Put a +1/+1 counter on an Army you control. It's also a Zombie. If you don't control an Army, create a 0/0 black Zombie Army creature token first.)\\nWhenever a Zombie token you control with power 6 or greater attacks, it gains lifelink until end of turn.", "Bojuka Bog enters the battlefield tapped.\\nWhen Bojuka Bog enters the battlefield, exile target player's graveyard.\\n{T}: Add {B}.", 'Charcoal Diamond enters the battlefield tapped.\\n{T}: Add {B}.', 'Choose a creature type. Draw a card for each permanent you control of that type.', 'Choose one —\\n• Destroy all creatures.\\n• Destroy all artifacts and enchantments.', 'Choose one. If you control a commander as you cast this spell, you may choose both.\\n• Target player draws X cards.\\n• Target player mills twice X cards.', 'Commander creatures you control get +2/+2 and have indestructible.', "Convoke (Your creatures can help cast this spell. Each creature you tap while casting this spell pays for {1} or one mana of that creature's color.)\\nDestroy all nontoken creatures.", 'Coven — At the beginning of combat on your turn, put a +1/+1 counter on up to one target creature you control. Then if you control three or more creatures with different powers, draw a card.', 'Create a 1/1 green Snake creature token, a 2/2 green Wolf creature token, and a 3/3 green Elephant creature token.', 'Create a 1/1 white Human creature token for each creature you control.\\nFlashback {8}{W}{W}. This spell costs {X} less to cast this way, where X is the greatest mana value of a commander you own on the battlefield or in the command zone. (You may cast this card from your graveyard for its flashback cost. Then exile it.)', 'Create thirteen tapped 2/2 black Zombie creature tokens.\\nFlashback {7}{B}{B}{B} (You may cast this card from your graveyard for its flashback cost. Then exile it.)', "Creatures with power less than Champion of Lambholt's power can't block creatures you control.\\nWhenever another creature enters the battlefield under your control, put a +1/+1 counter on Champion of Lambholt.", 'Creatures you control gain indestructible until end of turn.\\nAddendum — If you cast this spell during your main phase, put a +1/+1 counter on each of those creatures and they gain vigilance until end of turn.', 'Custodi Soulbinders enters the battlefield with X +1/+1 counters on it, where X is the number of other creatures on the battlefield.\\n{2}{W}, Remove a +1/+1 counter from Custodi Soulbinders: Create a 1/1 white Spirit creature token with flying.', 'Deathtouch\\nOther Zombie creatures you control get +1/+1.\\nWhenever another Zombie you control dies, target opponent loses 1 life.', 'Deathtouch\\nWhenever a Curse is put into your graveyard from the battlefield, return it to the battlefield attached to you at the beginning of the next end step.\\nAt the beginning of your upkeep, you may attach a Curse attached to you to one of your opponents. If you do, draw two cards.', "Defender\\nWhen Wall of Mourning enters the battlefield, exile a card from the top of your library face down for each opponent you have.\\nCoven — At the beginning of your end step, if you control three or more creatures with different powers, put a card exiled with Wall of Mourning into its owner's hand.", "Destroy target creature or enchantment an opponent controls. You lose life equal to that permanent's mana value.", 'Destroy target nonartifact creature.', 'Destroy target permanent. Its controller creates a 3/3 green Beast creature token.', "Dimir Aqueduct enters the battlefield tapped.\\nWhen Dimir Aqueduct enters the battlefield, return a land you control to its owner's hand.\\n{T}: Add {U}{B}.", 'Diregraf Colossus enters the battlefield with a +1/+1 counter on it for each Zombie card in your graveyard.\\nWhenever you cast a Zombie spell, create a tapped 2/2 black Zombie creature token.', 'Distribute three +1/+1 counters among one, two, or three target creatures, then double the number of +1/+1 counters on each of those creatures.', 'Draw a card for each creature you control with a +1/+1 counter on it. Those creatures gain indestructible until end of turn. (Damage and effects that say "destroy" don\'t destroy them.)', 'Draw a card for each creature you control.\\nFerocious — You gain 4 life for each creature you control with power 4 or greater.', 'Each opponent sacrifices an artifact. For each artifact sacrificed this way, you create a Treasure token.\\nFlashback {8}{R}{R}. This spell costs {X} less to cast this way, where X is the greatest mana value of a commander you own on the battlefield or in the command zone. (You may cast this card from your graveyard for its flashback cost. Then exile it.)', 'Each other player sacrifices a creature. You create a 2/2 black Zombie creature token for each creature sacrificed this way.', 'Each player mills X cards. For each creature card put into a graveyard this way, you create a tapped 2/2 black Zombie creature token.', "Enchant player\\nAt the beginning of enchanted player's draw step, that player draws two additional cards.\\nAt the beginning of enchanted player's end step, that player discards their hand.", "Enchant player\\nAt the beginning of enchanted player's upkeep, that player reveals cards from the top of their library until they reveal a creature card. Put that card onto the battlefield under your control. That player puts the rest of the revealed cards into their graveyard.", 'Enchant player\\nNonlegendary creatures enchanted player controls have base power and toughness 3/3 and lose all creature types.', "Enchant player\\nWhenever a land enters the battlefield under enchanted player's control, you create a 2/2 black Zombie creature token with decayed. (It can't block. When it attacks, sacrifice it at end of combat.)", 'Enchant player\\nWhenever a nontoken creature enchanted player controls dies, exile it and you create a 1/2 green Spider creature token with reach.', "Equipped creature has hexproof and haste. (It can't be the target of spells or abilities your opponents control.)\\nEquip {1}", 'Evolve (Whenever a creature enters the battlefield under your control, if that creature has greater power or toughness than this creature, put a +1/+1 counter on this creature.)\\n{T}: Add {G} for each +1/+1 counter on Gyre Sage.', "Exchange control of two target creatures you don't control.\\nFlashback {8}{U}{U}. This spell costs {X} less to cast this way, where X is the greatest mana value of a commander you own on the battlefield or in the command zone. (You may cast this card from your graveyard for its flashback cost. Then exile it.)", "Exile X target creature cards from your graveyard. For each card exiled this way, create a token that's a copy of that card, except it's a 4/4 black Zombie.", 'Exile target artifact or enchantment. If you cast this spell during your main phase, you may exile up to one other target artifact or enchantment.', 'Exile target artifact or enchantment. Put X +1/+1 counters on target creature you control, where X is the mana value of the permanent exiled this way.', 'Exile target creature. Its controller gains life equal to its power.', 'First strike (This creature deals combat damage before creatures without first strike.)\\nWhenever Odric, Master Tactician and at least three other creatures attack, you choose which creatures block this combat and how those creatures block.', 'First strike\\nWhen Knight of the White Orchid enters the battlefield, if an opponent controls more lands than you, you may search your library for a Plains card, put it onto the battlefield, then shuffle.', 'Flash\\nAt the beginning of your upkeep, each player mills three cards. You may exile a creature card from among the cards milled this way. If you do, Shadow Kin becomes a copy of that card, except it has this ability.', "Flash\\nFlying\\nWhenever Sigarda's Vanguard enters the battlefield or attacks, choose any number of creatures with different powers. Those creatures gain double strike until end of turn.", "Flash\\nLifelink\\nWhen Heron's Grace Champion enters the battlefield, other Humans you control get +1/+1 and gain lifelink until end of turn.", 'Flying\\nAs long as Dearly Departed is in your graveyard, each Human creature you control enters the battlefield with an additional +1/+1 counter on it.', 'Flying\\nOther Zombies you control have flying.\\nWhenever one or more Zombies you control deal combat damage to one or more of your opponents, you may draw cards equal to the number of opponents dealt damage this way. If you do, discard that many cards.', "Flying\\nWhen Angel of Glory's Rise enters the battlefield, exile all Zombies, then return all Human creature cards from your graveyard to the battlefield.", 'Flying\\nWhen Overseer of the Damned enters the battlefield, you may destroy target creature.\\nWhenever a nontoken creature an opponent controls dies, create a tapped 2/2 black Zombie creature token.', 'Flying\\nWhenever Butcher of Malakir or another creature you control dies, each opponent sacrifices a creature.', 'Flying\\nWhenever Herald of War attacks, put a +1/+1 counter on it.\\nAngel spells and Human spells you cast cost {1} less to cast for each +1/+1 counter on Herald of War.', 'Flying\\nWhenever one or more +1/+1 counters are put on another creature you control, you may put a +1/+1 counter on Enduring Scalelord.', 'Flying\\nWhenever you sacrifice a creature, target opponent sacrifices a creature.', 'Flying\\nYou and Humans you control have hexproof.\\n{2}, Exile a card from your graveyard: Create a 1/1 white Human Soldier creature token.', 'Flying\\n{B}, Sacrifice another creature: Regenerate Eater of Hope.\\n{2}{B}, Sacrifice two other creatures: Destroy target creature.', 'For each attacking creature, its owner puts it on the top or bottom of their library.', 'For each different power among creatures on the battlefield, choose a creature with that power. Destroy each creature not chosen this way.', "For each player, choose a creature card in that player's graveyard. Put those cards onto the battlefield under your control. They're black Zombies in addition to their other colors and types and they gain decayed. (A creature with decayed can't block. When it attacks, sacrifice it at end of combat.)", "If a Zombie you control would deal combat damage to a player, instead that player mills that many cards.\\nWhenever a creature card is put into an opponent's graveyard from their library, exile that card and create a 2/2 black Zombie creature token.", 'Indestructible\\nOther legendary permanents you control have indestructible.', 'Krosan Verge enters the battlefield tapped.\\n{T}: Add {C}.\\n{2}, {T}, Sacrifice Krosan Verge: Search your library for a Forest card and a Plains card, put them onto the battlefield tapped, then shuffle.', 'Kurbis, Harvest Celebrant enters the battlefield with a number of +1/+1 counters on it equal to the amount of mana spent to cast it.\\nRemove a +1/+1 counter from Kurbis: Prevent all damage that would be dealt this turn to another target creature with a +1/+1 counter on it.', 'Mikaeus, the Lunarch enters the battlefield with X +1/+1 counters on it.\\n{T}: Put a +1/+1 counter on Mikaeus.\\n{T}, Remove a +1/+1 counter from Mikaeus: Put a +1/+1 counter on each other creature you control.', 'Mortuary Mire enters the battlefield tapped.\\nWhen Mortuary Mire enters the battlefield, you may put target creature card from your graveyard on top of your library.\\n{T}: Add {B}.', 'Myriad Landscape enters the battlefield tapped.\\n{T}: Add {C}.\\n{2}, {T}, Sacrifice Myriad Landscape: Search your library for up to two basic land cards that share a land type, put them onto the battlefield tapped, then shuffle.', 'Other Zombie creatures you control get +1/+1.\\n{2}{B}, {T}: Exile target creature card from a graveyard. Create a 2/2 black Zombie creature token.', 'Other Zombies you control get +1/+1.\\n{1}{B}, {T}: All Zombies gain menace until end of turn.', 'Other Zombies you control get +1/+1.\\n{2}{B}, {T}, Sacrifice a creature: Return a Zombie creature card at random from your graveyard to the battlefield. Activate only during your turn and only if there are at least three Zombie creature cards in your graveyard.', 'Outlast {1}{W} ({1}{W}, {T}: Put a +1/+1 counter on this creature. Outlast only as a sorcery.)\\nEach creature you control with a +1/+1 counter on it has first strike.', 'Outlast {W} ({W}, {T}: Put a +1/+1 counter on this creature. Outlast only as a sorcery.)\\nEach creature you control with a +1/+1 counter on it has flying.', "Path of Ancestry enters the battlefield tapped.\\n{T}: Add one mana of any color in your commander's color identity. When that mana is spent to cast a creature spell that shares a creature type with your commander, scry 1. (Look at the top card of your library. You may put that card on the bottom.)", 'Put a +1/+1 counter on target creature, then double the number of +1/+1 counters on it.\\nFlashback {8}{G}{G}. This spell costs {X} less to cast this way, where X is the greatest mana value of a commander you own on the battlefield or in the command zone. (You may cast this card from your graveyard for its flashback cost. Then exile it.)', 'Return all Zombie creature cards from your graveyard to the battlefield tapped, then destroy all Humans.', 'Sacrifice X Zombies, then reveal cards from the top of your library until you reveal a number of Zombie creature cards equal to the number of Zombies sacrificed this way. Put those cards onto the battlefield and the rest on the bottom of your library in a random order.', 'Search your library for a basic land card, put it onto the battlefield tapped, then shuffle. Create a 0/1 colorless Eldrazi Spawn creature token. It has "Sacrifice this creature: Add {C}."', 'Search your library for up to X basic land cards, where X is the number of different powers among creatures you control. Put those cards onto the battlefield tapped, then shuffle.', "Selesnya Sanctuary enters the battlefield tapped.\\nWhen Selesnya Sanctuary enters the battlefield, return a land you control to its owner's hand.\\n{T}: Add {G}{W}.", 'Skeletons you control and other Zombies you control get +1/+1 and have deathtouch.', "Skulk (This creature can't be blocked by creatures with greater power.)\\nAt the beginning of your upkeep, you may discard all the cards in your hand. If you do, draw that many cards.", 'Sky Diamond enters the battlefield tapped.\\n{T}: Add {U}.', 'Tap five untapped Zombies you control: Put target creature card from a graveyard onto the battlefield under your control.', 'Target opponent puts a creature card of their choice from their graveyard onto the battlefield under your control.\\nFlashback {8}{B}{B}. This spell costs {X} less to cast this way, where X is the greatest mana value of a commander you own on the battlefield or in the command zone. (You may cast this card from your graveyard for its flashback cost. Then exile it.)', 'Target player creates X 2/2 black Zombie creature tokens, then up to one target creature gets -1/-1 until end of turn for each Zombie that player controls.', 'Temple of Deceit enters the battlefield tapped.\\nWhen Temple of Deceit enters the battlefield, scry 1.\\n{T}: Add {U} or {B}.', 'Temple of Plenty enters the battlefield tapped.\\nWhen Temple of Plenty enters the battlefield, scry 1.\\n{T}: Add {G} or {W}.', 'Trample\\nWhen Verdurous Gearhulk enters the battlefield, distribute four +1/+1 counters among any number of target creatures you control.', 'Vigilance\\nAs Riders of Gavony enters the battlefield, choose a creature type.\\nHuman creatures you control have protection from creatures of the chosen type.', 'Vigilance\\nCoven — At the beginning of combat on your turn, if you control three or more creatures with different powers, creatures you control gain indestructible until end of turn.', "Vigilance\\nWhenever another Human enters the battlefield under your control, put a +1/+1 counter on Heronblade Elite.\\n{T}: Add X mana of any one color, where X is Heronblade Elite's power.", "When Corpse Augur dies, you draw X cards and you lose X life, where X is the number of creature cards in target player's graveyard.", 'When Elite Scaleguard enters the battlefield, bolster 2. (Choose a creature with the least toughness among creatures you control and put two +1/+1 counters on it.)\\nWhenever a creature you control with a +1/+1 counter on it attacks, tap target creature defending player controls.', "When Eternal Skylord enters the battlefield, amass Zombies 2. (Put two +1/+1 counters on an Army you control. It's also a Zombie. If you don't control an Army, create a 0/0 black Zombie Army creature token first.)\\nZombie tokens you control have flying.", 'When Eternal Witness enters the battlefield, you may return target card from your graveyard to your hand.', 'When Fleshbag Marauder enters the battlefield, each player sacrifices a creature.', 'When Gisa and Geralf enters the battlefield, mill four cards.\\nOnce during each of your turns, you may cast a Zombie creature spell from your graveyard.', "When Gleaming Overseer enters the battlefield, amass Zombies 1. (Put a +1/+1 counter on an Army you control. It's also a Zombie. If you don't control an Army, create a 0/0 black Zombie Army creature token first.)\\nZombie tokens you control have hexproof and menace.", "When Moorland Rescuer dies, return any number of other creature cards with total power X or less from your graveyard to the battlefield, where X is Moorland Rescuer's power. Exile Moorland Rescuer.", 'When Ravenous Rotbelly enters the battlefield, you may sacrifice up to three Zombies. When you sacrifice one or more Zombies this way, each opponent sacrifices that many creatures.', 'When Somberwald Beastmaster enters the battlefield, create a 2/2 green Wolf creature token, a 3/3 green Beast creature token, and a 4/4 green Beast creature token.\\nCreature tokens you control have deathtouch.', "When Trostani's Summoner enters the battlefield, create a 2/2 white Knight creature token with vigilance, a 3/3 green Centaur creature token, and a 4/4 green Rhino creature token with trample.", 'When Yavimaya Elder dies, you may search your library for up to two basic land cards, reveal them, put them into your hand, then shuffle.\\n{2}, Sacrifice Yavimaya Elder: Draw a card.', "Whenever Kessig Cagebreakers attacks, create a 2/2 green Wolf creature token that's tapped and attacking for each creature card in your graveyard.", 'Whenever Undead Augur or another Zombie you control dies, you draw a card and you lose 1 life.', "Whenever Wild Beastmaster attacks, each other creature you control gets +X/+X until end of turn, where X is Wild Beastmaster's power.", 'Whenever a creature you control dies, put X +1/+1 counters on target creature you control, where X is the power of the creature that died.', 'Whenever a nontoken creature you control dies, Midnight Reaper deals 1 damage to you and you draw a card.', 'Whenever a nontoken creature you control dies, create a 2/2 black Zombie creature token.', 'Whenever another Human enters the battlefield under your control, put a +1/+1 counter on Kyler, Sigardian Emissary.\\nOther Humans you control get +1/+1 for each counter on Kyler.', "Whenever another Zombie you control dies, if it didn't have decayed, create a 2/2 black Zombie creature token with decayed. (It can't block. When it attacks, sacrifice it at end of combat.)\\nAt the beginning of your end step, you may sacrifice a Zombie. If you do, draw a card.", 'Whenever another creature enters the battlefield under your control, put a +1/+1 counter on that creature and a +1/+1 counter on Juniper Order Ranger.', 'Whenever another creature you control dies, investigate. (Create a Clue token. It\'s an artifact with "{2}, Sacrifice this artifact: Draw a card.")\\nWhenever you sacrifice a token, surveil 1. (Look at the top card of your library. You may put that card into your graveyard.)', 'Whenever you sacrifice another creature, exile it. If that creature was a token, put a +1/+1 counter on Prowling Geistcatcher.\\nWhen Prowling Geistcatcher leaves the battlefield, return each card exiled with it to the battlefield under your control.', 'You may pay {0} rather than pay the mana cost for Zombie creature spells you cast.', 'Zombies you control get +1/+0.\\nAt the beginning of your end step, if a creature died this turn, you may pay {1}{B}. If you do, create a 2/2 black Zombie creature token.', "Zombies you control get +1/+1.\\nWhen Liliana's Mastery enters the battlefield, create two 2/2 black Zombie creature tokens.", '[+1]: Create a 2/2 black Zombie creature token. Mill two cards.\\n[−3]: Return target creature card from your graveyard to the battlefield. That creature is a black Zombie in addition to its other colors and types.\\n[−7]: Destroy all non-Zombie creatures.', '{1}, {T}: Add {G}{W}.', '{1}, {T}: Add {U}{B}.', '{2}{U}, {T}, Exile a creature card from your graveyard: Create a 2/2 black Zombie creature token, then put a +1/+1 counter on each Zombie creature you control.', '{2}{U}, {T}: Each player mills three cards. Exile up to two creature cards put into graveyards this way. Create an X/X blue Zombie creature token, where X is the total power of the cards exiled this way.', '{3}, Sacrifice a creature or planeswalker: You gain 1 life and draw a card.', '{3}, {T}, Sacrifice another Zombie: Create two tokens that are copies of the sacrificed creature.', "{T}: Add one mana of any color in your commander's color identity.", "{T}: Add one mana of any color in your commander's color identity.\\nSacrifice Commander's Sphere: Draw a card.", '{T}: Add one mana of any color that a land an opponent controls could produce.', '{T}: Add three mana of any one color. Spend this mana only to cast creature spells.', "{T}: Add {B}.\\nWhenever a creature you control dies, put a corpse counter on Crowded Crypt.\\n{4}{B}{B}, {T}, Sacrifice Crowded Crypt: Create a 2/2 black Zombie creature token with decayed for each corpse counter on Crowded Crypt. (A creature with decayed can't block. When it attacks, sacrifice it at end of combat.)", '{T}: Add {C}.\\n{3}{G}, {T}, Sacrifice Blighted Woodland: Search your library for up to two basic land cards, put them onto the battlefield tapped, then shuffle.', "{T}: Add {C}.\\n{4}, {T}: Target creature can't be blocked this turn.", '{T}: Add {C}.\\n{T}: Add {G} or {W}. Talisman of Unity deals 1 damage to you.', '{T}: Add {C}.\\n{T}: Add {U} or {B}. Activate only if you control a Swamp.', '{T}: Add {C}.\\n{T}: Add {U} or {B}. Talisman of Dominance deals 1 damage to you.', '{T}: Add {C}{C}.', '{T}: Add {C}{C}. Activate only if you control five or more lands.', '{T}: Add {W}.']
flavor: ['"Approach my tower on bended knee or depart from it as ash upon the wind."\\n—Gadwick, the Wizened', '"As long as I stand, so will your cause."', '"Avacyn\'s protection is everywhere. From the holy church to the sacred glade, all that we see is under her blessed watch."', '"Bring forth the dead, their skull-grins and rattle-bones. We will feast upon their wailing ghosts."\\n—Silumgar, translated from Draconic', '"Did you have a nice nap?"\\n—Liliana Vess', '"Don\'t worry, there\'s plenty for everyone."\\n—Vickon, Eleventh Company battlemage', '"Even when the angels succumbed to madness, Sigarda stood strong. She is hope."', '"Fear holds no place in faith\'s battle plan."', '"Festival\'s just ahead. You\'re almost there!"', '"Hold on tight, little one. I\'ll get you to safety."', '"Hold the line, for family and the fallen!"', '"I know they\'re unstoppable fighters created to harvest souls—it\'s just they\'re so rude about it."\\n—Kaya', '"I was going to suggest silver, but a beam of pure angelic fury works even better."\\n—Rem Karolus, Fiendslayer', '"Inspiration is found by looking outward."\\n—Oviya Pashiri, sage lifecrafter', '"It was a strange morning. When we awoke, we found our trees transformed. We didn\'t know whether to water them or polish them."\\n—Pulan, Bant orchardist', '"Justice isn\'t done until undeath is undone."', '"Let those idiot priests tremble! A new era in unlife begins here and now. Oglor, raise the lightning vane!"\\n—Stitcher Geralf', '"Monsters dwell in every heart. We only think civilization tames them." ―Euphemia, Nexus watcher', '"My battle cry reaches ears far keener than yours."\\n—Saidah, Joraga hunter', '"My earliest work escapes me."\\n—Stitcher Geralf', '"Never forget our ancestors. They have not forgotten us."\\n—Mikaeus, the Lunarch', '"Now is the hour. Ours is the duty. For victory and family—charge!"', '"On vile wings and bloody wind, the swarm will rise."\\n—Skyclave inscription', '"So many corpses, so little time."', '"There are so many of them. It seems they\'ve just been waiting for someone to serve."', '"There is great wisdom in rushing headlong into combat . . . if you\'re prepared."\\n—Kenjek, captain of the Thousand Swords', '"There will come a day so dark you will pray for death. On that day your prayers will be answered."\\n—Minaldra, the Vizag Atum', '"These fiends are slightly less tolerable than you."\\n"A sentiment that warms my heart, sister."', '"They put bars on these noble beasts and then wonder why werewolves target our towns."', '"To see past the veil of death, cross it."\\n—*The Red Book of Mezdrithalik*', '"To survive exceptional times we must adapt by exceptional means."\\n—Vannifar', '"We fight together! In Sigarda\'s name, ready your weapons!"', '"We traffic in flesh, not souls. Still, it\'s a shame to let anything go to waste."\\n—Cevraya, Golgari shaman', '"When angels fall, humans must rise."', '"When gods become apathetic, the people will worship anyone who answers their pleas."\\n—Kiora', '"When they covered the world in city, all they did was give themselves nowhere to run."', '"Within our minds are limitless depths. Dive down, but don\'t forget to surface."\\n—Teferi', '"You can face any danger when all of nature is on your side."', 'Clare realized too late why no one ever took the shortcut through the abandoned mill.', "Countless ghouls surged through Thraben's streets, and with them came the city's salvation.", 'Even when the flesh grows cold, knowledge waits in the bones for a master to release it.', 'Every grave cradles a recruit.', 'First, whispers of ancient days. Then, visions of things to come.', 'For the necromancer barons, killing and recruitment are one and the same.', 'Furious and unable to separate, the bitter rivals consoled themselves by splitting everything else they saw in half.', 'Gods can be appeased. Demons, however . . .', 'Grixis is a world where the only things found in abundance are death and decay. Corpses, whole or in part, are the standard currency among necromancers and demons.', 'Having flesh is increasingly a liability on Mirrodin.', 'He ripped up board after board until his hands were bloody. Still, he could not find whatever it was he sought.', 'Her paean is the clash of spears, her prayer a battle cry.', 'His verdict is always guilty. His sentence is always death.', 'In their final moments, the demons gazed upon grace in its purest form.', 'It harmonizes with the essence of its master.', 'It started as a mere drop of water. The Magic Mirror crystallized it into much more.', 'It was a night like any other. It would soon become a night no one would ever forget.', 'Liliana inspires horror in many and fanatical admiration in a few.', "Lost to time is the artificer's art of trapping light from a distant star in a ring of purest gold.", 'Murky Otarian tides hide the forgotten treacheries of the Phyrexian war.', 'Necromancers deal in commodities far more precious than gold and grain.', 'No one welcomes his visit, yet all must grant him tribute.', 'On Otaria, peace and harmony are rare. Places that provide both are cherished.', 'On the continent of Tazeem, rushing waters plunge through narrow canyons into mist-cloaked lakes.', "Only the sun that beats down upon Arashin's walls could shine more brightly.", "Oona's song is like a twisted dinner chime. All the faeries return home, but it is Oona who feasts—on the stolen dreams and rumors they serve her.", 'Rumors quickly spread among thieves about a labyrinth without walls and a prize beyond all measures of worth.', "She keeps the festival's revels from faltering, infusing the witches' rituals with hope.", "She remembers every word spoken, from the hero's oath to the baby's cry.", 'Sigarda was the last uncorrupted archangel, but she would not have to fight alone.', 'Some timelines forever fray, branch, and intermingle. Others end abruptly.', 'Sometimes death comes knocking. Sometimes it tears down the walls.', 'The Cabal never expected its creations to create servants of their own.', 'The Curse of Wandering leaves only hatred.', 'The Harvesttide dance is one of joyous abandon, a last revel before winter nights.', 'The Orzhov care not for repentance, only repayment.', 'The continent of Murasa lies beneath a blanket of dense vegetation, its enormous branches tangled so thickly that some inhabitants never see the ground.', 'The essence of night to harden the soul.', 'The essence of wind to lift up the weary.', 'The fastest way across the dunes is above.', 'The gourd carving was supposed to take place *after* the feast.', 'The patrol found the graf empty save for a few well-chewed bones.', 'The smallest seed of regret can bloom into redemption.', 'They had no marble, so the faithful repaired her likeness with wood, straw, twine, and clay.', 'Those who are chosen do not doubt. Those who remain do not lament.', 'Though its mind has long since rotted away, it wields a sword with deadly skill.', 'To protect the alliance between Kjeldor and Yavimaya, they trained in the ways of both.', 'To serve as an Eternal is the afterlife granted to the worthy.', "Whether you'll fit in isn't up to you at all.", "With Thraben's army recalled to its city walls, outlying villages were left to fend for themselves."]
artist: ['Adam Paquette', 'Adam Rex', 'Alan Pollack', 'Alayna Danner', 'Alexander Mokhov', 'Andrew Mar', 'Andrew Robinson', 'Andrey Kuzinskiy', 'Anna Steinbauer', 'Brian Valeza', 'Bud Cook', 'Chris Cold', 'Chris Ostrowski', 'Chris Rahn', 'Chris Rallis', 'Christine Choi', 'Christopher Moeller', 'Cliff Childs', 'Clint Cearley', 'Colin Boyer', 'Cynthia Sheppard', 'Dan Murayama Scott', 'Daniel Ljunggren', 'Dave Allsop', 'David Rapoza', 'Dimitar Marinski', 'Dmitry Burmak', 'Eelis Kyttanen', 'Eric Deschamps', 'Evan Shipard', 'Fajareka Setiawan', 'Fariba Khamseh', 'Filip Burburan', 'Greg Hildebrandt', 'Grzegorz Rutkowski', 'Howard Lyon', 'Ironbrush', 'Irvin Rodriguez', 'Izzy', 'Jaime Jones', 'James Paick', 'James Zapata', 'Jana Schirmer & Johannes Voss', 'Jarel Threat', 'Jason A. Engle', 'Jason Chan', 'Jason Felix', 'Jesper Ejsing', 'Johan Grenier', 'Johann Bodin', 'John Avon', 'John Stanko', 'Jonas De Ro', 'Joseph Meehan', 'Justyna Dura', 'Karla Ortiz', "Kasia 'Kafis' Zielińska", 'Kev Walker', 'Kieran Yanner', 'Lie Setiawan', 'Lindsey Look', 'Marie Magny', 'Mark Zug', 'Marta Nael', 'Martina Fačková', 'Mathias Kollros', 'Matt Cavotta', 'Matt Stewart', 'Michael C. Hayes', 'Michael Komarck', 'Mike Bierek', 'Mike Dringenberg', 'Monte Michael Moore', 'Nils Hamm', 'Olena Richards', 'Omar Rayyan', 'Ron Spencer', 'Ruxing Gao', 'Ryan Alexander Lee', 'Ryan Barger', 'Ryan Pancoast', 'Ryan Yee', 'Sam Wolfe Connelly', 'Sara Winters', 'Scott M. Fischer', 'Sebastian Giacobino', 'Sidharth Chaturvedi', 'Slawomir Maniak', 'Stanton Feng', 'Steve Argyle', 'Steve Prescott', 'Steven Belledin', 'Svetlin Velinov', 'Todd Lockwood', 'Tomasz Jedruszek', 'Tuan Duong Chu', 'Tyler Jacobson', 'Victor Adame Minguez', 'Vincent Proce', 'Volkan Baǵa', 'Wayne England', 'Wayne Reynolds', 'Wisnu Tan', 'Yigit Koroglu', 'Zoltan Boros', 'rk post']
